    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d481">

                <pb facs="0541" n="525" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg525"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.24/6–2047</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chilean Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Nieto
                            del Rio</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-06-20">June 20, 1947</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have the honor to refer to this
                    Department’s note of May 26, 1947,<anchor n="44" xml:id="d481-f1"/> concerning
                    charges to the Government of Chile under the Lend-Lease Agreement.<anchor n="47"
                        xml:id="d481-f2"/>
                </p>
                <pb facs="0542" n="526" xml:id="pg526"/>
                <p>There are transmitted herewith two copies each of Statements LL–11 and LL–12 and
                    supporting schedules reporting charges through December 31, 1946.<anchor n="50"
                        xml:id="d481-f3"/> It will be noted that charges reported under Statement
                        LL–11 total $12,674.32 and that charges
                    reported under Statement LL–12 are
                    counterbalanced by credits to a total of $202,892.83 credit. Charges through
                    December 31, 1946 aggregate the grand total of $20,171,705.30.</p>
                <p>Of this grand total the appropriate percentage due to the Government of the
                    United States under the terms of the Agreement is $6,051,000. Since the
                    Government of Chile has already paid $5,000,000, the sum now due is
                        $1,051,000.<anchor n="51" xml:id="d481-f4"/>
                </p>
                <p>It is requested that these statements and schedules be treated by your Government
                    on a most confidential basis.</p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Secretary of State:<lb/>[File copy not signed]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d481-f1" n="44" xml:id="d481-f1-content">
