                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1943, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">v</hi>, p. 816</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d481-f3" n="50" xml:id="d481-f3-content">
