            </note>
            <note corresp="#d481-f4" n="51" xml:id="d481-f4-content">
                <p>A memorandum of conversation of July 14, 1947, indicated that the Chilean
                    Minister Counselor delivered a cheek for this amount (825.24/7–1447).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
